iation":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124063","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124063","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124063.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124063.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"xatlas.cpp uses `realloc`/`free` when initializing its allocation function pointers (`s_realloc`/`s_free`), but relied on those symbols being pulled in transitively by another header. Newer macOS SDKs no longer expose `realloc`/`free` through such transitive includes, breaking the build with:\n\n```\nthirdparty/xatlas/xatlas.cpp:166:32: error: use of undeclared identifier 'realloc'; did you mean 's_realloc'?\n```\n\nThis adds the explicit `<stdlib.h>` include and documents it as a patch file under `thirdparty/xatlas/patches/` plus a `Patches:` section in `thirdparty/README.md`, per thirdparty conventions.\n\nBug confirmed and fix verified by a successful `scons` build once the include is added.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","closed_by":{"login":"jfulponi","id":61839284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxODM5Mjg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61839284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi","html_url":"https://github.com/jfulponi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfulponi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"